ld #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]`sase task`: durable, session-aware background tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every SASE background task is durably recorded, listable and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inspectable from the CLI, attributed to the TUI session it came [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from, and launchable with `sase task run`; approving an epic runs [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its `sase bead work` bead creation as one of these visible tasks [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]instead of an invisible detached process.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]background_tasks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust task store and bindings[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Rust task store and bindings' section: add the locked, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retention-bounded background-task record store and its `sase_core_rs` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bindings in the sase-core repo.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]SASE session registry and display identity[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]sessions[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'SASE session registry and display identity' section: register live TUI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sessions, resolve session references, and render the short colored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]session chip shared by the CLI and TUI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python task facade, ids, logs, and the history limit[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]facade[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Python task facade, ids, logs, and the history limit' section: wrap the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust store in a `sase.tasks` facade with task ids, bounded log files, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the new `tasks.history_limit` config field.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Detached task supervisor and submit API[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]runner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after facade[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Detached task supervisor and submit API' section: run tasks under a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detached supervisor that owns status transitions, log capture, kill, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wait, and orphan reconciliation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The `sase task` command surface[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runner, sessions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'The `sase task` command surface' section: add `sase task list`, `sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task show`, and `sase task run` with rich human output, JSON output, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Admin Center Tasks tab over the durable store[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runner, sessions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Admin Center Tasks tab over the durable store' section: mirror in-TUI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks into the store, render store-backed and cross-session tasks in the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Tasks tab, and keep the event loop free of store I/O.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route approved-epic bead creation through the task runner[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black